    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/a916d61c6c560a2a185eb1694745098c.poster.avif?t=1742312336\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/a916d61c6c560a2a185eb1694745098c.webm?t=1742312336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/a916d61c6c560a2a185eb1694745098c.mp4?t=1742312336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealer</strong> is a platformer with Metroidvania elements. You start the game as a thief who, just like you, understands nothing. As you explore the locations, you are immersed in darkness, but you have a precious lantern. Look for clues and interact with the environment to achieve your goals.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Difficulty</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/dccbe62dd84d1e7f672aff13dbf7ca7f.poster.avif?t=1742312336\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/dccbe62dd84d1e7f672aff13dbf7ca7f.webm?t=1742312336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/dccbe62dd84d1e7f672aff13dbf7ca7f.mp4?t=1742312336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a challenging platformer. Don\u2019t think you\u2019ll be able to simply run past all the obstacles! Sometimes you can make things easier by tackling challenges wisely or even avoiding them altogether. However, this depends on your attentiveness and ability to analyze the situation. Stay alert and use your skills to successfully complete the game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interesting Mechanics</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealing</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To obtain the desired item, you need to steal it, and this doesn\u2019t always happen quickly. Be cautious and calculated to ensure everything goes as planned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/a51f36b41403c3c8f68a4c4b632928bc.poster.avif?t=1742312336\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/a51f36b41403c3c8f68a4c4b632928bc.webm?t=1742312336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/a51f36b41403c3c8f68a4c4b632928bc.mp4?t=1742312336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Candles</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your path can be illuminated not only by the lantern but also by candles. However, remember that you\u2019ll need matches for this, which are currently in short supply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/126d5ab4b52b13f5e9d083ace7f0f3a4.poster.avif?t=1742312336\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/126d5ab4b52b13f5e9d083ace7f0f3a4.webm?t=1742312336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/126d5ab4b52b13f5e9d083ace7f0f3a4.mp4?t=1742312336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lockpicking</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a thief, which means a locked door is no obstacle for you. So, pick those locks, but don\u2019t forget about your lockpicks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/ab08c3b36322b6ace34d2d5b81d46ff8.poster.avif?t=1742312336\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/ab08c3b36322b6ace34d2d5b81d46ff8.webm?t=1742312336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/ab08c3b36322b6ace34d2d5b81d46ff8.mp4?t=1742312336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >World Secrets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is far from as simple as it may seem at first glance. The lantern can\u2019t always illuminate every corner or reveal all the secrets. Explore hidden rooms to find more valuable loot and uncover the mysteries lurking in the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/da94813d66b3cfa746d671ff93b1d476.poster.avif?t=1742312336\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/da94813d66b3cfa746d671ff93b1d476.webm?t=1742312336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/da94813d66b3cfa746d671ff93b1d476.mp4?t=1742312336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add to Your Wishlist</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is just a part of the aspects of our game that we\u2019ve managed to share. To learn more, dive into the captivating world by playing our demo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/7b46e80684318ac5ed2d59d2a75a0a59.avif?t=1742312336\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/a916d61c6c560a2a185eb1694745098c.poster.avif?t=1742312336\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/a916d61c6c560a2a185eb1694745098c.webm?t=1742312336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/a916d61c6c560a2a185eb1694745098c.mp4?t=1742312336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealer</strong> is a platformer with Metroidvania elements. You start the game as a thief who, just like you, understands nothing. As you explore the locations, you are immersed in darkness, but you have a precious lantern. Look for clues and interact with the environment to achieve your goals.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Difficulty</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/dccbe62dd84d1e7f672aff13dbf7ca7f.poster.avif?t=1742312336\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/dccbe62dd84d1e7f672aff13dbf7ca7f.webm?t=1742312336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/dccbe62dd84d1e7f672aff13dbf7ca7f.mp4?t=1742312336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a challenging platformer. Don\u2019t think you\u2019ll be able to simply run past all the obstacles! Sometimes you can make things easier by tackling challenges wisely or even avoiding them altogether. However, this depends on your attentiveness and ability to analyze the situation. Stay alert and use your skills to successfully complete the game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interesting Mechanics</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealing</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To obtain the desired item, you need to steal it, and this doesn\u2019t always happen quickly. Be cautious and calculated to ensure everything goes as planned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/a51f36b41403c3c8f68a4c4b632928bc.poster.avif?t=1742312336\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/a51f36b41403c3c8f68a4c4b632928bc.webm?t=1742312336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/a51f36b41403c3c8f68a4c4b632928bc.mp4?t=1742312336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Candles</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your path can be illuminated not only by the lantern but also by candles. However, remember that you\u2019ll need matches for this, which are currently in short supply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/126d5ab4b52b13f5e9d083ace7f0f3a4.poster.avif?t=1742312336\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/126d5ab4b52b13f5e9d083ace7f0f3a4.webm?t=1742312336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/126d5ab4b52b13f5e9d083ace7f0f3a4.mp4?t=1742312336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lockpicking</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a thief, which means a locked door is no obstacle for you. So, pick those locks, but don\u2019t forget about your lockpicks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/ab08c3b36322b6ace34d2d5b81d46ff8.poster.avif?t=1742312336\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/ab08c3b36322b6ace34d2d5b81d46ff8.webm?t=1742312336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/ab08c3b36322b6ace34d2d5b81d46ff8.mp4?t=1742312336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >World Secrets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is far from as simple as it may seem at first glance. The lantern can\u2019t always illuminate every corner or reveal all the secrets. Explore hidden rooms to find more valuable loot and uncover the mysteries lurking in the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/da94813d66b3cfa746d671ff93b1d476.poster.avif?t=1742312336\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/da94813d66b3cfa746d671ff93b1d476.webm?t=1742312336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/da94813d66b3cfa746d671ff93b1d476.mp4?t=1742312336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add to Your Wishlist</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is just a part of the aspects of our game that we\u2019ve managed to share. To learn more, dive into the captivating world by playing our demo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535210/extras/7b46e80684318ac5ed2d59d2a75a0a59.avif?t=1742312336\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
